# Release / AltStore

- Unsigned IPA only in CI (`scripts/build-ipa.sh`)
- Version via `scripts/auto-version.py` + conventional commits
- Prepend versions in `altstore/apps.json` (newest first); unique `buildVersion`
- Align AltStore permission text with `Atlasbound/Info.plist`
- See skill `altstore-release` and `docs/release.md`
